    public DocumentDefinition Create() => DocumentDefinition.Create(ScribeNode.Create(
        "Original CAR and Borcherds identities for the descent current",
        H("Original CAR and Borcherds identities for the descent current"), Blocks(
            Paragraph(Text("For every D : LatticeData, use the original tensor state carrier, ghostB, originalMode, actual parity P and descentCurrent. Write B_j = ghostB D j, mu_n(x,y) = originalMode D n x y and K(x,y) = mu_0(B_(-1)x,y). The input lattice has exactly rank : Nat, an integral Gram matrix G, symmetry and even diagonal. No positivity or nondegeneracy is added, and rank zero remains allowed wherever the displayed hypotheses permit it.")),
            Paragraph(Text("The current identities use the original CAR, actual beta field and signed Borcherds residue calculus. H appears only in the energy statements, with both equations H * gramComplex D = 1 and gramComplex D * H = 1. They keep every original lattice charge, all original states and the original epsilon conventions. Neither a critical rank nor a no-ghost assertion is introduced.")),
            Paragraph(Text("Source-specific four-slot Reg audits for the public theorems remain unfinished: https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/issues/29596. Of the original 19 theorem targets recorded there, 18 remain: 7 in this module, 5 in LatticeMatterGhostNumberCovariance and 6 in LatticeBRSTPhysicalLie. The removed current_zero_energy declaration accounts for the retired target; its retirement does not complete an audit or rewrite the issue's original 19-target history. Adjacent templates do not supply the complete original telescopes, source selections and checked escape coordinates for these owners. No declared_validated registration is claimed; this delivery uses the explicit linked-issue exception.")),
